From: Manoj Kumar Prabakaran <manojkumar.prabakaran@arm.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 16:52:33 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] oem: arm: collect crashlog files as a system dump

Collect crashlog files exposed by the Arm OEM path through PLDM File
Transfer without invoking the PLDM File D-Bus Open() method.

Handle Device File state sensor Updated events, discover crashlog
FileDescriptor objects created from File Descriptor PDRs, wait for each
file size, and start transfers with the internal FileDescriptor
startFileTransfer() API.

Collect all matching crashlog files for one event window into a single
archive before notifying the System Dump manager.

Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/pldm/+/93724]

Signed-off-by: Manoj Kumar Prabakaran <manojkumar.prabakaran@arm.com>
Change-Id: Iaefea5b752d494a771688455cab7885149c994ac
